<doc id="59215" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=59215" title="Philae">
Philae

Philae (&lt;a href="Basa%20Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;: Φιλαί, Philai; &lt;a href="Basa%20Mesir"&gt;Mesir kuna&lt;/a&gt;: Pilak, P'aaleq; &lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt;: أنس الوجود‎‎, Anas el Wagud) iku &lt;a href="pulo"&gt;pulo&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="kali"&gt;kali&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kali%20Nil"&gt;Nil&lt;/a&gt; lan tilas situs komplèk candhi Mesir kuna ing &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt; kidul. Komplèk iki diprèthèli lan dipindhah menyang pulo liya ing sacedhaké déning UNESCO sawisé kebanjiran nalika pangyasa &lt;a href="wadhuk"&gt;bendungan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Bendungan%20Aswan"&gt;Aswan&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Situation</h2>
Situation.
Philae disebutaké déning para panulis kuna, kalebu &lt;a href="Strabo"&gt;Strabo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Diodorus"&gt;Diodorus&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ptolemy"&gt;Ptolemy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Seneca%20the%20Younger"&gt;Seneca&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pliny%20the%20Elder"&gt;Pliny the Elder&lt;/a&gt;. Situs iki minangka sebutan tumrap rong pulo cilik sing dumunung ing garis ujur &lt;a href="24th%20parallel%20north"&gt;24° lor&lt;/a&gt;, sacedhaké &lt;a href="Aswan"&gt;Aswan&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Mesir%20kuna"&gt;Basa Mesir kuna&lt;/a&gt;: Swenet, "Trade;"). &lt;a href="Groskurd"&gt;Groskurd&lt;/a&gt; ngitung let antara kaloro pulo lan Aswan watara 61.5 mil (99&amp;nbsp;km).
