<doc id="59368" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=59368" title="Kali Drina">
Kali Drina

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Kali Drina (&lt;a href="Aksara%20Sirilik%20Serbia"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt;: Дрина) iku sawijining &lt;a href="kali"&gt;kali&lt;/a&gt; kang mili saka tlatah antara &lt;a href="Serbia"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bosnia-Herzegovina"&gt;Bosnia-Herzegovina&lt;/a&gt;, lan minangka kali &lt;a href="karst"&gt;karst&lt;/a&gt; gedhé dhéwé ing pagunungan Alpen Dinara (‘’Dinaric Alps’’) kang kalebu laladan ilèn &lt;a href="Kali%20Danube"&gt;Kali Danube&lt;/a&gt;. Kali iki dawané 346 kilomèter minangka anak kali (‘’tributary’’) saka &lt;a href="Kali%20Sava"&gt;Kali Sava&lt;/a&gt;, lan dadi tapel wates antara &lt;a href="Bosnia-Herzegovina"&gt;Bosnia-Herzegovina&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Serbia"&gt;Serbia&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng kali iki asal saka &lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;basa Latin&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="basa%20Latin"&gt;Latin&lt;/a&gt;: Drinus) kang asalé saka basa &lt;a href="Basa%20Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Basa%20Yunani%20kuna"&gt;Basa Yunani kuna&lt;/a&gt;: 'Dreinos').
