Dhataran Pannonia

Dhataran Pannonia utawa Pannonian Plain iku dhataran jembar ing &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20Tengah"&gt;Éropa Tengah&lt;/a&gt; sing sisa nalika &lt;a href="Pliocene"&gt;Pliocene&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sagara%20Pannonia"&gt;Sagara Pannonia&lt;/a&gt; surut. Dhataran iki wujud sawijining subsistem &lt;a href="geomorphology"&gt;geomorphological&lt;/a&gt; saka Sistem Sabuk Alpen-Himalaya.
Kali &lt;a href="Kali%20Danube"&gt;Kali Danube&lt;/a&gt; mérang dhataran dadi loro. Dhataran utamáné dumadi saka &lt;a href="Dhataran%20amba%20Hungaria"&gt;Dhataran amba Hungaria&lt;/a&gt; (ing sisih kidul lan wétan) lan &lt;a href="Dhataran%20cilik%20Hungaria"&gt;Dhataran cilik Hungaria&lt;/a&gt; (ing sisih lor-kulon).
