Mraz iku &lt;a href="vegan"&gt;vegan&lt;/a&gt;, lan duwé kebon alpukat ing &lt;a href="North%20County"&gt;Northern San Diego County&lt;/a&gt; cedhak&lt;a href="Fallbrook%2C%20California"&gt;Fallbrook&lt;/a&gt;.
